{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 95,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Oh come, let’s sing to the LORD. Let’s shout aloud to the rock of our salvation!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "来啊，我们要向耶和华歌唱，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "來啊，我們要向耶和華歌唱，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Let’s come before his presence with thanksgiving. him with songs!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我们要来感谢他，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我們要來感謝他，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "For the LORD is a great God, a great King above all gods.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因耶和华为大 神，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因耶和華為大上帝，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "In his hand are the deep places of the earth. The heights of the mountains are also his.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "地的深处在他手中；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "地的深處在他手中；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "The sea is his, and he made it. His hands formed the dry land.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "海洋属他，是他造的；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "海洋屬他，是他造的；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "Oh come, let’s worship and bow down. kneel before the LORD, our Maker,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "来啊，我们要屈身敬拜，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "來啊，我們要屈身敬拜，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "for he is our God. We are the people of his pasture, and the sheep in his care. Today, oh that you would hear his voice!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为他是我们的 神；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為他是我們的上帝；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "Don’t harden your heart, as at Meribah, as in the day of Massah in the wilderness,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们不可硬着心，像当日在， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們不可硬着心，像當日在， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "when your fathers tempted me, tested me, and saw my work.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那时，你们的祖宗试我探我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那時，你們的祖宗試我探我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "Forty long years I was grieved with that generation, and said, “They are a people who err in their heart. They have not known my ways.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "四十年之久，我厌烦那世代，说：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "四十年之久，我厭煩那世代，說：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "Therefore I swore in my wrath, my rest.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "所以，我在怒中起誓，说：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "所以，我在怒中起誓，說：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}